source: crates/standalone/fixture/src/lib.rs
---
Make an organization, with you as its owner.

Usage: ink org create [OPTIONS] <NAME>

Arguments
  <NAME>  What it is called: one line, at most 64 characters

Account
      --api <URL>          The API's address, `http://host[:port]`;
                           `account.api` in the config file [env: INK_API]
      --timeout <SECONDS>  Seconds one call may take [default: 30]
                           [env: INK_TIMEOUT]

Global  -C, --json, -q, -v, --color, --no-progress, --log, --log-file
        (see `ink --help`)
More    ink org create --help adds examples, notes and exit codes
